                "tab_content": "<p>The timeline depends on the requirements, integrations and review stages. We discuss milestones in your proposal rather than promise a fixed delivery date before discovery.</p>"
              },
              {
                "_id": "p000054",
                "tab_title": "Can you improve an existing website?",
                "tab_content": "<p>Yes. Tell us what is working, what needs to change and which platform you use. We will review the existing site before recommending the scope.</p>"
              },
