                "_id": "p000055",
                "tab_title": "How are revisions and support handled?",
                "tab_content": "<p>Revision stages, communication and any ongoing support are agreed in the project scope. Ask us to include the support you need in your proposal.</p>"
              },
              {
                "_id": "p000056",
                "tab_title": "Are these demos client projects?",
                "tab_content": "<p>No. The demonstrations use synthetic data and illustrative brands. They show interface concepts and interactive workflows; they are not testimonials or deployed client products.</p>"
